A***************************************************************
     A* LFCPPSTAT - Join Logical File over PPQ_CPP + PPQSTTSTCS
     A* (PPQ_STATISTICS). DDS replacement for SQL view V_PPQ_CPP_STATS.
     A* JDFTVAL approximates the original LEFT JOIN PPQ_STATISTICS - a
     A* CPP with no calculated statistics yet still returns a row.
     A* NOTE: if a CPP has multiple PPQ_STATISTICS rows over time, this
     A* join returns all of them (one row per calc) - filter/sort by
     A* CALC_TS in RPG if only the latest is wanted; DDS join LFs cannot
     A* express "most recent" the way the original correlated join did.
     A***************************************************************
     A                                      JDFTVAL
     A          R CPPSTATR                  JFILE(PPQ_CPP PPQSTTSTCS)
     A          J                           JOIN(1 2)
     A                                      JFLD(PROTOCOLID PROTOCOLID)
     A                                      JFLD(CPP_SEQ CPP_SEQ)
     A            PROTOCOLID                JREF(1)
     A                                      ALIAS(PROTOCOL_ID)
     A            CPP_SEQ                   JREF(1)
     A            PARAM_NAME
     A            LOWERLIMIT
     A                                      ALIAS(LOWER_LIMIT)
     A            TARGET
     A            UPPERLIMIT
     A                                      ALIAS(UPPER_LIMIT)
     A            CRTCLTY
     A                                      ALIAS(CRITICALITY)
     A            CP
     A            CPK
     A            PP
     A            PPK
     A            MEAN_VAL
     A            STD_DEV
